Z||000005||Tigger||06-06-2001||02:03 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hyhy4u:<BR><B>Nope, none of the rear bumpers have anything Etched in them, the only two places on the car that you can tell what it is, is on the front bumper emblem and the rear tail lights on the Gt's.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>'84 indy, '85 GT and coupe rear bumpers have "Pontiac" "etched" in them.  Fastbacks have a "GT" piece in the trim.<P>MrFeeArrow, yes it will be a direct swap.  '84 & '85 coupes have the same bumper.  The one's with the butt cheeks anyway.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 06-06-2001).]||||reg||1
